How optimization conflicts manage in FSL:
dispatcher activates resource schedule optimization for a resource that’s part of a dataset being optimized through in-day optimization. 
If an overlap is detected, a message is shown and the newly initiated optimization request is aborted. Similarly, when a dispatcher tries to make changes to the Gantt,
which is being processed by a background optimization request such as in-day optimization, a message is shown notifying the dispatcher that their changes can 
create unwanted results.



